    "agents": "Agents",
    "kanban": "Kanban",
    "overviewText": "Hermes Commander is a mission-control PWA for startups and solopreneurs. It runs a daemon on your machine (Mac/miniPC/Linux) and lets you monitor and direct AI agents from your phone, tablet, or desktop over Tailscale.",
    "projectsText": "A project is a folder or git repo. Open a folder, create a new one, or clone a remote repo. Each project can have multiple missions.",
    "missionsText": "A mission is a goal executed by an orchestrator agent (Hermes). Each mission can use a worktree, a branch, or no git isolation. Missions can depend on other missions.",
    "agentsText": "Hermes is always the orchestrator. Codex, OpenCode, and Claude are executor agents. Enable/disable them in Settings.",
    "kanbanText": "Each mission can have a kanban board. The orchestrator reports task progress to the board as it delegates and completes work."
  },
